{
  "title": "Machine-Certified Lean 4 Formalization of the General Divisor Theorem (GDT): Exact Density Correction under Residue Conditioning",
  "description": "Standalone machine-checked Lean 4 formalization of the General Divisor Theorem (GDT). Proves exact minimal period T_min = lcm(m, rad(N)), sharp admissibility gcd(a, d) = 1, and the Euler product correction factor C(N, m) = d / phi(d) with 0 sorry. Includes an exhaustive 2,287-parameter Python verification suite. Based on the theoretical monograph by thinkthoughts (Dan, @Precedent_Vice).",
